{
  "version": 2,
  "why": "Compose P2 (F2, N1): SSE gateways subscribe once per video to a pub/sub channel and fan out in memory, replacing polling. Remaining flaws: the service writes SQL and then publishes (a dual write), and every comment still goes to every viewer of a hot video.",
  "nodes": [
    { "id": "client", "kind": "client", "label": "Viewers' apps", "x": 60, "y": 260 },
